---
description: User-visible UI must not expose implementation paths or dev jargon
globs: frontend/src/**/*.tsx
---

# Product UI copy

- Do **not** show repo paths (e.g. `backend/data/…`), JSON filenames, API route strings, `localhost`, or port numbers in normal user-facing labels, helper text, or success states.
- Error messages should stay generic (“try again”, “check your connection”) unless the product intentionally surfaces a support code.
- Document data sources and file layout in **comments**, **README**, or backend docs—not in the interface.
